Flow:

1. External APIs provide dining data.
2. Extraction Service fetches data.
3. Store raw data in S3.
4. Publisher Service reads S3.
5. Publish events to Kafka.
6. Consumer services process events.
7. Glue transforms data.
8. Athena generates reports.

